{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739055783806894110","content":"<@!260820438026813440> \n\nWeb is roaming around on the hunt with Baeshra... a sudden pain shoots through their spine and they begin convulsing as extra limbs and appendages begin forming from their body one after the other they try to scream for help but they fall silent once again only mouth out the screams... after some time web resembles a horrific eldritch horror of a wild shape unable to call for help unable to scream in agony, Baeshra finally notices and just as she goes to help SHK an appendage of webs goes straight through Baeshras body... leaving her dead and Web unable to do anything but watch the appendage retract into their body. The horrific Web creature then begins to howl at the pain they’re feeling but to no avail as no sound is able to leave their throat... Web remains there till dawn unable to move, speak, or save their beloved.\n\nYou experience this nightmare, don't gain the benefits of a long rest, gain a point of exhaustion, and reduce max hp by:","created_at":"2020-08-06T09:40:26.882000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740866871817011200","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
