{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739055783806894110","content":"<@!363458590461132800> \n\nBaeshra is on the hunt. She follow scent. Track prey. Taking her time. The forest buzzes with insects. The trees seem to move behind her, lumbering in a chase. But she is focused on her prey. She hears rustling ahead of her. She pounces on her prey, teeth sinking into its stony jugular. The neck crunches. She pulls back, confused, looking at her prey. She sees blueish green skin. Spiders around. It is Web. Somehow stone, but bloody. Baeshra awakens. She falls back asleep, but the dream restarts. Except this time it’s Wren. Then it’s Skitter. The 🎵. Then Subeak. Then Wynne. Then Cato. All through the night.\n\nYou also don't gain a long rest, gain a point of exhaustion, experience this nightmare, and reduce max hp by:","created_at":"2020-08-06T09:41:31.053000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740867140969824288","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
